        <activityName xml:lang="en">CPU, network equipment, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: CPU, network equipment, at plant
The data set represents the production of CPUs for data centers; UUID: b68e8a8b-ed8d-31aa-88f0-ed665218fbc1
The dataset is based on an average three CPUs found in rack and blade servers. According to literature, the logic IC type is used. The CPU housing is also considered.
Location: Data for global average for CPUs
Technology: Typical CPUs for data centers
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b68e8a8b-ed8d-31aa-88f0-ed665218fbc1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
